.superpowers/

# A journal written by running the CLI without AGENT_JOURNAL_ROOT set. It has
# TWO fallbacks and the first rule here only covered one of them, so this
# happened twice: `$HOME/.agents/journal`, which becomes `./.agents/journal`
# when HOME is unset, and a bare `workspaces/` under the cwd. Both carry the
# machine hostname in their segment paths, and scripts/verify-skills.mjs cannot
# catch either — it walks skills/ only, and does not scan .jsonl.
#
# Ignore them wherever they land, not just under the package, since the cwd of
# a dev invocation is not fixed.
**/.agents/journal/
packages/agent-journal/workspaces/
workspaces/
